# =============================================================================
# NEVER COMMIT MANUAL PDFs OR THEIR EXTRACTS.
#
# The A330 FCOM, QRH, FCTM, MEL, AFM, PRC, NPC-CB, PERF, FOM and FODM are
# proprietary company documents. They are licensed to the airline, not to us,
# and this repo is published to the open web. Committing a manual PDF, or a
# text extract of one, redistributes it. Do not do it, not even briefly, not
# even in a branch: git history is forever and a force push does not undo a
# fetch.
#
# The manuals live in Drive and in project knowledge. The portal cites them by
# manual code and section. It never carries their text wholesale. Quoted
# verbatim in a study item is a short excerpt for a single fact, which is a
# different thing from shipping the document.
# =============================================================================
*.pdf
extracts/
*_extract.md
*.extract.md

# Audio lives in its own repo. Podcast and drill audio is large, binary, and
# regenerated often; keeping it here bloats every clone.
*.mp3
*.m4a
*.wav

# OS cruft
.DS_Store
.DS_Store?
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
ehthumbs.db
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

